# --- Answer keys and generators: defence in depth -------------------------------
# These live OUTSIDE this repository by design (D11.1, A8) — placement is the
# primary control. The patterns below are insurance against an accidental copy
# landing inside the tree, NOT enforcement: `git add -f` still overrides them,
# and a key committed to public history is permanent.
ANSWER_KEY*
README.original.md
answer-keys/
**/answer-keys/
_generators/
**/_generators/

# --- Run ledger (D9) ------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived, local-only, and regenerable from the scorecard directory, so losing it
# costs nothing. The exact filename is fixed in [P2]; adjust if it differs.
run-ledger.jsonl
*.ledger.jsonl

# NOTE: scorecards are deliberately NOT ignored. They are the durable,
# tamper-evident record (D9) and are meant to be committed. Do not add them here.

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# --- OS / editor junk -----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
